Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there, Rohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.42,0:00:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, I guess it picked up on my scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.66,0:00:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If those freaky-ass\Nphalanges catch up to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can kiss my body's nutrients goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't travel faster than\N60 kilometers per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky for me, this bike\Ncan easily outpace it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Problem is, I have no\Nclue how to find the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That foot fetish dick could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.28,0:00:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about this logically.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he lay a trap inside\Na tunnel wall of all places?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd think ambushing us from the\Nside of the road would be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.91,0:00:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there has to be more to this\Nnutrient feeding than meets the eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means there's some\Nsignificance to the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got no choice but to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to dig up some info\Non that Futatsumori tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.90,0:00:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know just the man for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get Koichi and Reverb to\Nhelp me track down the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's got you all riled\Nup, sweetie? It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I gave him the slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now where's my card?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.44,0:01:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.30,0:01:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be shitting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.08,0:01:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd it just appear out of thin air?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going 80 kilometers per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.54,0:01:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its top speed is only 60.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.30,0:01:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should have gotten here\Ntwo minutes after I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.70,0:01:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's simple math!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though being a stand and all, I guess\Nit can pop in whenever it wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After it figures out your\Nrough location, it appears,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.38,0:01:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and uses scent to move in for the kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta get out of here and fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,S-60 kilometers!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.64,0:01:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! What the? Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a baby carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.88,0:02:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I decelerate, I'm a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Rohan, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slowing down isn't an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna have to gun it hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.92,0:02:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Shining Diamond, do your thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And fix!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.48,0:02:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this weight, I'll never\Nget a chance to call Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
