Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.80,0:04:08.26,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(142,900)\fs60}Episode 29: {\fs80} Highway Star, Part 2
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.80,0:04:08.26,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(142,900)\fs60}Episode 29: {\fs80} Highway Star Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just in the nick of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can consider that to me, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.40,0:04:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have a guardian angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There goes a billion yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn thing must have\Nbroken when I grabbed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.14,0:04:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for a guardian angel. Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hate me so much, just hang up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.77,0:04:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you say that, Minayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to propose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.75,0:04:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you more than anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it is my lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, do I have some great timing, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Hirosei residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.92,0:05:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't find the user,\NI'm as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get the feeling he has an\Nobsession with the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he has a grudge\Nagainst it or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any info on incidents\Ninvolving that tunnel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was published in\Nthe paper two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually remember seeing\Nsomething about this on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some careless biker guy\Nwas driving real drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.32,0:05:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and ended up crashing into\Nthe tunnel's entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to this, he's unconscious\Nand covered head to toe in bruises.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in intensive care at\NBurugaoka Hospital now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, sounds like the stand got him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.90,0:05:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.06,0:05:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember the news reporting\Nthere was blood all over the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said the stand feeds by\Nabsorbing people's nutrients, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wounds are totally different.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the rider from the motorcycle\Naccident actually became the stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.72,0:06:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's right, this guy's leeching\Nnutrients from others to heal himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.94,0:06:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't catch a break today!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta think faster, that water's\Ngonna mean some major shrinkage!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can turn there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just have to keep it over\N60 kilometers an hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.72,0:06:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, whatever you do,\Nstay on the line, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, this is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm totally about to fight it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, if anyone can make this turn,\Nit's Josuke Higashikata. Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that, you\Nfungal-footed asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clear that corner\Nwithout a single scratch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.06,0:06:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the actual hell?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.88,0:06:51.64,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: No Entry
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm charging straight\Nfor the port of Mariah!
