Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.59,0:06:51.64,Maskmask,NoEntry,0,0,0,,{=0}{\blur1.6\an7\pos(0,0)\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HB2B9BB&}m 1211 575 l 1161 605 981 706 891 755 1075 738 1143 719 1179 692 1206 666
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining Diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now fix that broken wall! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had me right in its crosshairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now that the wall's up,\Nit's been totally blinded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that means this\Nthing finds its prey
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.40,0:07:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like a mosquito sniffs out its next meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no rhyme or reason\Nto any of its attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its only objective is to\Ndrain me of my nutrients.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That theory about this\Nbeing the drunk dude
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.28,0:07:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the accident is\Nstarting to make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.32,0:07:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all coming together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, I worked it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy from the accident\Nhas to be the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to find out what his name is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, this is such a shitty situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:07:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea how I'm\Ngoing to get out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now where did that meddlesome\Nlittle shit Josuke go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you selected that half-dead\Nbiker punk as your next pincushion,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it caught me off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.84,0:08:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were crazy, but\NI see now how wrong I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely astonishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought that kid\Nwould bring forth Highway Kick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stands are truly a\Nmanifestation of the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hungrier they are, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The insatiable hunger to\Nheal oneself is unstoppable,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.98,0:08:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially when it comes to stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.14,0:08:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But oh, how nice it would have been\Nto witness Josuke bite the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.46,0:09:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ditch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding a disc that emptied into\Nthe ocean was a lucky break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I still have no way to beat this\Nthing and it's closing in on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.48,0:09:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell am I supposed\Nto make my escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So which way let's see the oceans behind\Nme and I need to steer way clear of the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.62,0:09:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,water so going right isn't really an option\Nand I'm pretty sure I came from the left
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.98,0:09:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which way do I go now I feel like the\Nocean's to the left but what if it's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.86,0:09:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,actually to the right there's also the\Nmiddle to think about what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gunning it, but the stupid\Nbike is still slowing down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,C-could it be busted?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The engine's working just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why won't the damn thing accelerate?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grinding to a halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap! It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.20,0:10:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I out of gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, you had me freaking\Nout for a second there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm just in need of a little refill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.16,0:10:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to sweat\Nover something so minor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was starting to worry\NI had a major wreck on
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my hands that even Shining\NDiamond couldn't fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, not gonna stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.30,0:10:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can get out of this situation easy Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was freaking out over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.04,0:10:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little tweak here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:11:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a little modification there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.32,0:11:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It teleports though, so I guess\NI can't get too comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I have fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I'm being honest with myself,\NI'm lost, which really sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.60,0:11:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how do I get to\Nthat freaking hospital?
