Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.00,0:11:32.08,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Budogaoka General Hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.42,0:11:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I'm in a bit of a pickle here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to know how to\Nfind the guy from the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,drunk driving accident\Nin Futatsu Mariah Tunnel,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I need to know right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's his room number?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off my case, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I suggest you read\Nthat sign over there.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.97,0:11:49.48,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Visiting hours are over for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.32,0:11:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need your eyes examined, then you\Ncan come back tomorrow morning at 9.30.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:11:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not here for a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to know his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:11:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you didn't hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked you to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pesky kids like you always\Nmakes life hard for us adults,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it really gets under my skin. Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're pretty shrimpy for\Nsomeone who belongs to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.32,0:12:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a biker gang Do your feet\Neven reach the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it act three.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, master, let's kill the hoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness that would\Nhave been a disaster
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These medications run\Nus 50,000 yen a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.44,0:12:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there\Npitching and hold me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Miss Adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that Hey You supposed\Nto be directed toward me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.30,0:12:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.22,0:12:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one here besides me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hold this much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.98,0:13:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a personal problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.00,0:13:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you told me to go home, so I\Nshouldn't get involved, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, since I'm so shrimpy,\NI probably couldn't reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I do have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.26,0:13:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is your superior going to\Nreprimand you if those break?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would do just about anything\Nto keep that from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.30,0:13:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you his room number.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yu-Yupon Cameo is in room 525.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take that elevator up to\Nthe fifth floor and you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.54,0:13:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.90,0:13:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, did you find out where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to head to the fifth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name's Yuya Fungami in room 525.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.24,0:13:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you're the best, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand, take the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put an end to this Joe's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.64,0:14:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard's slipping his way in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using Reverb Act Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.92,0:14:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what any of\Nus would do without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for having my back, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Three Freeze can only\Nfocus his attack one at a time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of those things\Nare going after Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Room 525!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I finally made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fence!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.27,0:14:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you stop me when I'm so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.94,0:14:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I'm gonna kick your ass\Ninto oblivion even if it kills me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.48,0:15:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because when I make it to that bed, I'm\Ngoing to beat you within an inch of your...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell does this\Ndouchebag think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.42,0:15:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you waltz into this\Nroom without permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is you's room, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.76,0:15:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave that loser alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't look so hot, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it had been a while since that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first guy in the tunnel\Ngave me his nutrients,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now I know what\Nwas holding up my meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're the second sap I've\Nbeen chasing around, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making it this far is commendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of shocked actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.24,0:15:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.16,0:15:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know who this guy is, you baby? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.00,0:15:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.98,0:15:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the guy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.66,0:15:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't care less who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice going, Highway Kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.52,0:16:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just what the doctor ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if I can just get a hold of\Na few more suckers like this dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to make a\Nfull recovery in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.17,0:16:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear her, Buster?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your ass up and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.84,0:16:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question is, did you\Nhear me? Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.22,0:16:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop wasting your time with that guy and\Ngive me some of that sweet, sweet loving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.80,0:16:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't forget about little\Nold hurting me, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.54,0:16:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to take the piss of a lifetime,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm not sure how much\Nlonger I can hold it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.10,0:16:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, looks like it's time\Nfor me to get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.40,0:16:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all agreed to take turns!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my turn to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.62,0:16:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I haven't gotten to do it yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.72,0:16:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who does it, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just bring out that piss\Nbottle and give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.31,0:16:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, then I'll be over here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Akemi! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.18,0:16:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The peach you're holding has gone\Nbad, so use another one, okay, babe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, but how did you know it was rotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can smell that thing over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.98,0:17:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any idiot could tell it was rotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You smelled it from there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sense of smell must\Nhave gotten better lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're right. It's rotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my nose is correct, one of\Nyou beauties is on your period.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right, aren't I? Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's you, Yoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.78,0:17:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hit the nail on the head and what's this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone in here is\Ngetting really pissed off?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When agitated the body\Nproduces adrenaline and one of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you girls has discharged\Nquite the pungent secretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the grumpy Gertrude Rock dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.94,0:17:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.34,0:17:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm as happy as a clam,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,baby We're all just happy that you're\Nfeeling like your old self again snow gums.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.72,0:17:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've all been waiting for\Nthis moment We couldn't be mad
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we wanted to right now\Nnow now honeys tell the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody in this room\Nis downright furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can smell it loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better not be fibbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of you is about to\Npop, so tell me who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.90,0:18:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That full-bodied odor you're whiffing\Nis courtesy of yours truly, you dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your body should be a\Nnutritional wasteland by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the hell are you standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.26,0:18:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were sucking down my IV\Nlike a malnourished vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just a taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.96,0:18:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so it was enough to perk me up a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan, you're holding him captive in\Nthe tunnel, but that's about to end
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You imbecilic numbnut.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like you've totally forgotten\Nthat highway Kick has your scent
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear a\Npeep out of you three
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.26,0:18:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can call me Josuke Higashikata, and\Nmy stand is known as Shining Diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:18:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm limited to close-range attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can assure you my punching\Nspeed is a lot faster than 60 kmh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never measured, but if I'm close\Nenough, I'm sure I can get to about 300 kmh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.02,0:19:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.68,0:19:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know by now you've heard that\Nmy back has been broken to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My arms and legs are fractured, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even roll over to scratch my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.06,0:19:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really gonna slap around a\Nfeeble bedridden hospital patient?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was a jerk, but if you let me go,\NI'll free the guy in the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's still alive, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It certainly wouldn't hurt\Nto give him some nutrients.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do we have a deal or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't beat up a\Npoor invalid, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're not that cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.72,0:19:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you did, you couldn't\Ncall yourself a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.06,0:19:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so back off, you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, guess you got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.38,0:19:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beating the shit out of an injured victim\Nwould leave a real bad taste in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.22,0:19:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it definitely wouldn't be manly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.32,0:19:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.80,0:19:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:20:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kicking the ass of a tool like me\Nwill haunt your conscience forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.28,0:20:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To prevent that nightmare, I've taken\Nthe liberty of fixing you up. Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.22,0:20:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congrats, you're completely healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.20,0:20:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.64,0:20:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you've gotten a clean bill\Nof health from Shining Diamond,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.98,0:20:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I pound your ass into the ground, I\Ncan avoid looking like a coward, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuya Fugami's hospital stay, extended.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you so much as think about\Nhealing yourself with Highway Kick,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just rearrange your\Nface all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.70,0:20:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insisted Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I feel so invigorated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.34,0:20:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like it's the early\Nhours of New Year's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.16,0:20:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I just put on a fresh\Npair of my favorite underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.48,0:21:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, being nursed back to health by\Nadoring fangirls isn't too shabby either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for Rohan...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.12,0:21:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, look, Rohan-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.56,0:21:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we're not friends, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you heal me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.02,0:21:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have preferred wasting away\Nthan have the likes of you save my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to run away, but as always, you\Nhad to step right into the enemy's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you function?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, you and I are even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.94,0:21:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just when it seemed,\NRohan had come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On a different note, Koichi Hirose\Ndecided to go on a walk with his dog.
