Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a British Shorthair.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.22,0:22:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from,\Nyou little sweetie?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.43,0:22:52.80,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.80,0:22:55.06,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.06,0:22:57.85,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.85,0:22:59.52,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.52,0:23:01.90,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.90,0:23:04.27,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.27,0:23:07.07,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.07,0:23:08.78,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.78,0:23:11.03,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.46,0:23:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little bit closer.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.03,0:23:13.37,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.37,0:23:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.37,0:23:14.99,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.48,0:23:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.99,0:23:17.62,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.62,0:23:22.13,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.14,0:23:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I need you,\Nbut ooh, I gotta find you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.13,0:23:25.67,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.44,0:23:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you.
